<node id="Bjt">
  <data key="d0">Bjt</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">BJT, or bipolar junction transistor, is a type of transistor with current amplification capabilities, used in amplifying and switching circuits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae080121232af020ad6ba3a6ec2d7d3f</data>
  <data key="d4">半导体材料介绍.txt</data>
