  <data key="d0">Fet/Mosfet</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FET, or field-effect transistor, is a voltage-controlled device with high input impedance, serving as a fundamental unit in modern large-scale integrated circuits like CPUs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae080121232af020ad6ba3a6ec2d7d3f</data>
  <data key="d4">半导体材料介绍.txt</data>
