<node id="Integrated Circuit (Ic)">
  <data key="d0">Integrated Circuit (Ic)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An integrated circuit (IC) is a semiconductor device that combines a large number of transistors, resistors, capacitors, and other components on a single chip.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae080121232af020ad6ba3a6ec2d7d3f</data>
  <data key="d4">半导体材料介绍.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770982432</data>
