  <data key="d5">1770983001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mask (Reticle)">
  <data key="d0">Mask (Reticle)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Mask is a transparent plate with circuit patterns used in photolithography, typically four times the size of the actual chip design.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29d2df4d26a3885b820e69482a2d3ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Critical Dimension (CD)">
  <data key="d0">Critical Dimension (CD)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Critical Dimension refers to the smallest line width that can be manufactured, often corresponding to the gate length in semiconductor processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29d2df4d26a3885b820e69482a2d3ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Yield">
  <data key="d0">Yield</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Yield is the percentage of functional chips on a wafer, serving as a key economic indicator in semiconductor manufacturing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29d2df4d26a3885b820e69482a2d3ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FinFET">
  <data key="d0">FinFET</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FinFET is a 3D transistor structure that improves current control compared to planar transistors, used in 22nm to 3nm processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29d2df4d26a3885b820e69482a2d3ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GAA (Gate-All-Around)">
  <data key="d0">GAA (Gate-All-Around)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GAA is an advanced transistor structure where the gate surrounds the channel, used in 3nm and smaller processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29d2df4d26a3885b820e69482a2d3ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EUV (Extreme Ultraviolet)">
  <data key="d0">EUV (Extreme Ultraviolet)</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">EUV is a lithography technology using 13.5nm wavelength light, essential for manufacturing chips below 7nm.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29d2df4d26a3885b820e69482a2d3ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Layer Metal Interconnect">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Layer Metal Interconnect</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-Layer Metal Interconnect refers to the complex network of metal lines in modern chips, typically ranging from 10 to 15 layers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29d2df4d26a3885b820e69482a2d3ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrated Circuit Manufacturing Process">
  <data key="d0">Integrated Circuit Manufacturing Process</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Integrated Circuit Manufacturing Process refers to the complex series of steps used to create microelectronic circuits on silicon wafers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Silicon Wafer">
  <data key="d0">Silicon Wafer</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Silicon wafer is the base material used in semiconductor manufacturing, typically made from purified silicon.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cleanroom">
  <data key="d0">Cleanroom</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A cleanroom is a controlled environment with extremely low levels of particulates, essential for semiconductor fabrication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Front-End-of-Line">
  <data key="d0">Front-End-of-Line</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Front-End-of-Line refers to the initial stages of semiconductor manufacturing, including transistor formation and interconnects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Back-End-of-Line">
  <data key="d0">Back-End-of-Line</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Back-End-of-Line refers to the later stages of semiconductor manufacturing, focusing on metal interconnections and packaging.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thin Film Deposition">
  <data key="d0">Thin Film Deposition</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Thin Film Deposition is a process used to coat the wafer with layers of materials such as insulators or metals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Photolithography">
  <data key="d0">Photolithography</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Photolithography is a critical process that transfers circuit patterns onto the wafer using light and photoresist.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chemical Mechanical Polishing">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Mechanical Polishing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Mechanical Polishing is a process used to flatten the surface of the wafer after multiple layers are deposited.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metallization">
  <data key="d0">Metallization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Metallization is the process of creating conductive pathways (wires) on the chip to connect transistors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ASML EUV Lithography Machine">
  <data key="d0">ASML EUV Lithography Machine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">ASML EUV Lithography Machine is a high-precision tool used in photolithography for advanced chip manufacturing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Silicon Dioxide">
  <data key="d0">Silicon Dioxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Silicon dioxide is a compound used as an insulating layer in semiconductor devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mask Reticle">
  <data key="d0">Mask Reticle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A mask reticle is a transparent plate with a circuit pattern used in photolithography to project the design onto the wafer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sputtering">
  <data key="d0">Sputtering</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sputtering is a physical vapor deposition technique used to deposit thin metallic layers on the wafer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chemical Vapor Deposition">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Vapor Deposition</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Vapor Deposition is a process used to deposit thin films by chemical reactions in a gaseous state.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983003</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plasma Etching">
  <data key="d0">Plasma Etching</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Plasma Etching is a dry etching technique that uses ionized gas to remove material from the wafer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Annealing">
  <data key="d0">Annealing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Annealing is a heat treatment process used to repair crystal lattice damage and activate implanted ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Silicon Ingot">
  <data key="d0">Silicon Ingot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Silicon ingot is a single-crystal silicon rod produced by the Czochralski process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Czochralski Process">
  <data key="d0">Czochralski Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Czochralski Process is a method used to grow single-crystal silicon ingots from molten silicon.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wafer Fabrication">
  <data key="d0">Wafer Fabrication</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Wafer Fabrication refers to the entire process of creating integrated circuits on a silicon wafer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Semiconductor Process">
  <data key="d0">Semiconductor Process</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Semiconductor Process is the overall set of techniques used to manufacture electronic components on a silicon wafer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef94f588ef70d0bd8967e7353481a56</data>
  <data key="d4">集成电路制造工艺.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1770983004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
